coreos-bootupd for Debian

Note that many dependencies are currently missing from Debian. This
package currently only builds when using the upstream-cargo build
profile, which reaches out to crates.io for dependencies during
package build and thus results in builds that are not suitable for
inclusion directly in Debian.  Help packaging dependencies would be
greatly appreciated.

